<item><title>Neves wins Cape Verde presidential vote with nearly 64%</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/neves-wins-cape-verde-presidential-vote-with-nearly-64-7fadb9/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/neves-wins-cape-verde-presidential-vote-with-nearly-64-7fadb9/</guid><category>Cabo Verde</category><description>Preliminary counts from 98% of ballots give the incumbent José Maria Neves a first-round lead over Joana Rosa, who has 31.5%.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:00:53 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/neves-wins-cape-verde-presidential-vote-with-nearly-64-7fadb9/share.jpg" length="40415" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/neves-wins-cape-verde-presidential-vote-with-nearly-64-7fadb9/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Police destroy three cannabis plantations in Picos Acima</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/police-destroy-three-cannabis-plantations-in-picos-acima-32680f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/police-destroy-three-cannabis-plantations-in-picos-acima-32680f/</guid><category>Cabo Verde</category><description>Judicial police destroyed the cannabis plants on three agricultural plots in Picos Acima on Thursday, November 12.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:47:10 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" length="34079" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
